        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton 8-3/4\" Cabin Door Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with the legendary attention to quality that Hamilton Sinkler is known for, this 8-3/4 inch cabin door hook is a wonderful, if not functional, addition to any door.  It is made from solid bronze with a bronze patina finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DCH-202-size.jpg?v=1704354565\" width=\"580\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Hamilton DCH-202 Cabin Hook Sizes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 8-3/4\" Bronze Cabin Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Plate Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid authentic bronze with a Bronze Patina finish.</li>\r\n<li>Package includes 5 Slotted oval head wood screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p><br><br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued.</b> See available <a href=\"/collections/door-hooks-bolts-latches-and-locks\"><b>Door Hooks</b></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly 1 Left.\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
